{"unit_id":"caishengshuo__beforewrite#card-zh","repo":"caishengshuo/beforewrite","commit":"c617a52a622769a6d4dd050e161d67f46f2afde2","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"BeforeWrite 是 DSH 的文件版本快照与回滚插件：它监听文件服务的写入和编辑前事件，在旧内容被替换前保存快照，并提供 time_machine 工具查看历史、比较差异、恢复版本、查看统计或手动快照。Web 界面在 shell.overlay 中显示会话时间轴，可查看台词、工具动作和文件快照并发起回档。适合希望找回 agent 改动前文件内容的 DSH 用户；数据保存在本机 ~/.dsh/time-machine/，可用 DSH_HOME 更改根目录。bash 等绕过文件服务的操作需手动创建快照。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:318-348","index.js:657-690","index.js:789-796","client.js:293-318"]}
{"unit_id":"caishengshuo__beforewrite#card-en","repo":"caishengshuo/beforewrite","commit":"c617a52a622769a6d4dd050e161d67f46f2afde2","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"BeforeWrite snapshots files before DSH file-service writes and edits. The time_machine tool browses history, compares changes, restores versions, and creates snapshots. Its timeline shows session activity and snapshots with restore controls. Data stays local; shell changes need a manual snapshot.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:318-348","index.js:657-690","index.js:789-796","client.js:293-318"]}
