{"unit_id":"caishengshuo__beforewrite#feature-1","repo":"caishengshuo/beforewrite","commit":"c617a52a622769a6d4dd050e161d67f46f2afde2","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"BeforeWrite 的功能「自动保存写入前版本」：BeforeWrite 在文件服务写入或编辑前保存旧内容，按文件列出快照历史，适合恢复被 agent 覆盖的代码或配置。触发方式是 DSH 文件服务执行 write 或 edit。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:318-348","index.js:789-790"]}
{"unit_id":"caishengshuo__beforewrite#feature-2","repo":"caishengshuo/beforewrite","commit":"c617a52a622769a6d4dd050e161d67f46f2afde2","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"BeforeWrite 的功能「按快照比较文件」：BeforeWrite 可根据快照编号生成与当前文件的差异，显示文本文件的行级变化。通过 time_machine 的 diff 动作触发。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:510-568","index.js:657-690"]}
{"unit_id":"caishengshuo__beforewrite#feature-3","repo":"caishengshuo/beforewrite","commit":"c617a52a622769a6d4dd050e161d67f46f2afde2","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"BeforeWrite 的功能「恢复文件快照」：BeforeWrite 将指定快照内容写回目标文件，同时把恢复前内容也存成新快照，便于再次恢复。通过 time_machine 的 restore 动作触发。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:570-630","index.js:657-690"]}
{"unit_id":"caishengshuo__beforewrite#feature-4","repo":"caishengshuo/beforewrite","commit":"c617a52a622769a6d4dd050e161d67f46f2afde2","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"BeforeWrite 的功能「会话时间轴」：BeforeWrite 在 Web 界面按会话展示台词、工具动作和文件快照，并可从快照条目发起回档。点击 shell.overlay 中的时光机入口查看。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:224-289","client.js:174-220","client.js:222-290","client.js:316-318"]}
{"unit_id":"caishengshuo__beforewrite#feature-5","repo":"caishengshuo/beforewrite","commit":"c617a52a622769a6d4dd050e161d67f46f2afde2","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"BeforeWrite 的功能「手动创建快照」：BeforeWrite 的 time_machine 工具可为指定路径主动保存版本，适用于 shell 命令等不会触发文件服务写入钩子的操作。输入路径和原因，通过 snapshot 动作触发。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:657-690","index.js:318-348"]}
{"unit_id":"caishengshuo__beforewrite#caveat-1","repo":"caishengshuo/beforewrite","commit":"c617a52a622769a6d4dd050e161d67f46f2afde2","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"BeforeWrite 自动快照仅覆盖经过 DSH 文件服务的写入或编辑；rm、sed -i 和重定向等 shell 操作不会触发钩子，需事先手动 snapshot。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:757-790","index.js:657-684"]}
{"unit_id":"caishengshuo__beforewrite#caveat-2","repo":"caishengshuo/beforewrite","commit":"c617a52a622769a6d4dd050e161d67f46f2afde2","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"BeforeWrite 对超过 2 MiB 的文件不保存完整内容；二进制内容会被标记，diff 与 restore 拒绝将其当文本处理，因此不能从界面还原二进制文件。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:23-32","index.js:60-76","index.js:318-348"]}
